{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07644","headline":"田园观雨兼晴後作 · 孟云卿","name":"田园观雨兼晴後作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫贱少情欲，借荒种南陂。\n我非老农圃，安得良土宜。\n秋成不廉俭，岁余多馁饥。\n顾视仓廪间，有粮不成炊。\n晨登南园上，暮歇清蝉悲。\n早苗既芃芃，晚田尚离离。\n五行孰堪废，万物当及时。\n贤哉数夫子，开翅慎勿迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}